(5) Other epic UAT plans under docs/plan/ for cross-epic test coverage

PRODUCE: Epic UAT plan containing:
(1) Acceptance scenarios derived from each user journey -- concrete end-to-end scenarios with preconditions, steps, expected outcomes that prove the journey works
(2) Success metrics validation plan -- how each metric from success-metrics.md will be measured and what constitutes pass/fail
(3) Cross-epic integration test scenarios -- where this epic's capabilities interact with other epics
(4) Risk-based test priorities -- which scenarios must pass first based on research risk assessment and feasibility review findings
(5) Persona-based acceptance matrix -- for each persona, which scenarios validate their needs are met

EXIT GATE:
- Every user journey has at least one acceptance scenario
- Every success metric has a validation method
- Risk areas from research and feasibility reviews have targeted scenarios
- Plan is actionable for feature-level decomposition into test strategies
